      'Navar ceremonies conducted for students during the year.',
      'Annual Jashan celebrated with full priestly rituals.',
      'Prize-giving ceremony held to felicitate students for academic and scriptural achievements.',
    ],
  },
  {
    year: '2021–22',
    items: [
      'SSC 2021: Shyamak R. Sanjana (81.60%), Persheus Y. Turel (81.00%), Sohrab G. Vimadalal (80.20%), Zahan M. Turel (74.60%).',
      'New admissions taken in June 2021.',
      'Annual Jashan and prize-giving ceremony conducted.',
      'Religious and Avesta classes continued throughout the year.',
    ],
  },
  {
    year: '2019',
    items: [
      'SSC 2019: Amavand Rumi Panthaky (78.00%).',
      'CENTENARY YEAR: The Institute celebrated 100 years of service to the Zoroastrian community in 2019.',
